{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45072","headline":"夏日集李司直纵溪斋 · 皎然","name":"夏日集李司直纵溪斋","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"修景属良会，远飙生烦襟。\n泄云收净绿，衆木积芳阴。\n疏涤府中务，迢遥湖上心。\n习闲得招我，赏夜宜泛琴。\n山近资性静，月来寄情深。\n澹然若事外，岂藉隳华簪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45072.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45072","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}